    "Su tabla trae 0-12 y 13-25; la plantilla pide 0-5, 6-17, 18-59 y 60+. No hay forma de convertir una en otra sin volver al dato crudo.": "Your table has 0-12 and 13-25; the template asks for 0-5, 6-17, 18-59 and 60+. There is no way to convert one into the other without going back to the raw data.",
